# ==============================================================================
# Database: Hostname Pattern Heuristics
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Regex Pattern | OS / Model Name | Confidence Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Evaluated in order against lowercase hostnames (DHCP/DNS/NetBIOS).
#   2. Specific hardware models MUST be at the top (e.g. galaxy-s24 before galaxy).
#   3. Generic prefixes (^win, desktop-, laptop-, server-, nas-) MUST stay at the bottom.
#   4. Use valid Device Type tokens (pc, server, console, smartphone, etc.).
#
# Example:
#   steam-?deck|Steam Deck (SteamOS)|96|console|Valve
#   desktop-[a-z0-9]+|Windows Desktop PC|88|pc|Microsoft
# ==============================================================================

